            <style>
  /* Section 3 - Main Container */
  .icertis-contracts-section {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1300px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 100px 30px;
    background-color: #f7f8f8;
  }

  .icertis-contracts-section *,
  .icertis-contracts-section *::before,
  .icertis-contracts-section *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* Heading */
  .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-heading {
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    font-size: 40px;
    line-height: 52px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-highlight {
    color: #874451;
    font-size: inherit;
    line-height: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
  }

  /* Description */
  .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-description {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #000000;
  }

  /* Mission Description */
  .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-mission {
    margin: 0 0 64px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000000;
  }

  .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-mission strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Three Images - Flex Layout */
  .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-image-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-image-item {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-image-item img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 0;
  }

  /* Tablet */
  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .icertis-contracts-section {
      padding: 70px 30px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-heading {
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 44px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-description,
    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-mission {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 25px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-mission {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-image-row {
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }

  /* Mobile */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .icertis-contracts-section {
      padding: 48px 30px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-heading {
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-description {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-mission {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-image-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-image-item {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  /* Small Mobile */
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .icertis-contracts-section {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-heading {
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 34px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-mission {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .icertis-contracts-section .icertis-contracts-image-row {
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="icertis-contracts-section">

  <h2 class="icertis-contracts-heading">
    Every business
    <span class="icertis-contracts-highlight">
      runs on contracts.
    </span>
  </h2>

  <p class="icertis-contracts-description">
    Icertis envisions a future where human-controlled
    systems of agents negotiate favorable agreements,
    address regulatory risk in real time, and trigger
    downstream business actions &ndash; all based on
    what&rsquo;s agreed to and codified in contracts.
    The rules of business captured by contracts will
    form the foundation for the autonomous enterprise.
  </p>

  <p class="icertis-contracts-mission">
    <strong>
      To help enterprises get there, we&rsquo;re
      committed to our mission of empowering customers
      to realize the full potential of every contract.
    </strong>
  </p>

  <div class="icertis-contracts-image-row">

