<h2>Respect</h2>
<p>We strive to be an organization where everyone is treated with respect and every voice is heard. We assume positive intent in our interactions and regard everyone&rsquo;s feedback and contributions as valuable. We embrace and celebrate diversity, and know that only by doing so can we be the best at what we do.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="tabbed-content__image-wrap">
                                                        <img class="tabbed-content-image " src="/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png" alt="" width="606" height="396" srcset="/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=36 36w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=54 54w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=109 109w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=70 70w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=140 140w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=180 180w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=360 360w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=200 200w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=400 400w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=275 275w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=550 550w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=300 300w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=600 600w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=303 303w,&#xA;/contentassets/ad8c093bd3c84543a8b9b935316ec2f0/vector-1.png?width=606 606w" loading="lazy" />
                                                    </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="tab-pane fade "
                                     id="tab-32027-pane" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-32027"
                                     tabindex="0">
                                    <div
                                        class="tabbed-content__info-wrap rich-text-area tab-content__col-swap">
                                                    <div class="tabbed-content__text-wrap">
                                                        
<h2>Teamwork</h2>
<p>Every Icertian who is considered a top performer must also be a team player&mdash;we don&rsquo;t tolerate brilliant jerks. We know that success is the result of hard work from people across the organization, and we go out of our way to recognize the teams that make individuals successful.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="tabbed-content__image-wrap">
                                                        <img class="tabbed-content-image " src="/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png" alt="" width="606" height="396" srcset="/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=36 36w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=54 54w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=109 109w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=70 70w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=140 140w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=180 180w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=360 360w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=200 200w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=400 400w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=275 275w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=550 550w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=300 300w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=600 600w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=303 303w,&#xA;/contentassets/8db832c92c15435b98d0759b4f3ceffd/vector-2.png?width=606 606w" loading="lazy" />
                                                    </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="tab-pane fade "
                                     id="tab-32028-pane" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-32028"
                                     tabindex="0">
                                    <div
                                        class="tabbed-content__info-wrap rich-text-area ">
                                                    <div class="tabbed-content__text-wrap">
                                                        
<h2>Execution</h2>
<p>Execution is in our DNA. We hold ourselves accountable to deliver for our customers, partners, and fellow Icertians each and every day. To guide us we have a mantra: &ldquo;Focus, Follow up, Follow through&mdash;Fast!&rdquo; We set our sights on a goal, hold ourselves accountable for success, and see it through to the end, quickly.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="tabbed-content__image-wrap">
                                                        <img class="tabbed-content-image " src="/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png" alt="" width="606" height="396" srcset="/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=36 36w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=54 54w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=109 109w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=70 70w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=140 140w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=180 180w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=360 360w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=200 200w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=400 400w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=275 275w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=550 550w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=300 300w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=600 600w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=303 303w,&#xA;/contentassets/e69bbe0963114986954fc557231e3d6c/vector-3.png?width=606 606w" loading="lazy" />
